{
  "$comment": [
    "perfect36 skill code -> ACT Command drill topic.",
    "",
    "perfect36 runs a 77-code dotted taxonomy; this bank runs a flatter one that",
    "matches how the real test groups each section (English rule-by-rule, Reading",
    "and Science skill-integrated). Several codes therefore collapse onto one",
    "topic - all seven math.fun.* codes are 'functions' here - and that is the",
    "intended direction: a student practising 'functions' should get piecewise and",
    "domain-range items in the same pile, because the test does not label them.",
    "",
    "Every value must be a topic some existing question or some zone in paths.json",
    "already declares. A topic invented here would not fail check-content.mjs",
    "(rule 4 validates zone->topic, not topic->zone) but would land the items in a",
    "bucket no landmark feeds and weakestTopics() has no history for.",
    "",
    "The eight values that are zone-only today - text structure, tone, evidence,",
    "figurative language, units, rates, hypotheses, calculating from data - are the",
    "NO_DRILL_TOPIC whitelist in check-content.mjs, i.e. landmarks with no drill",
    "questions at all. Mapping onto those is a feature: it is the content gap the",
    "whitelist exists to record.",
    "",
    "The import fails loudly on any skill code missing from this file rather than",
    "guessing or dropping the item silently."
  ],

